<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title><%= typeof title !== 'undefined' ? title : 'Tra Cứu Linh Kiện & Bắt Lỗi Code - STEM Robotic Edu' %></title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Be+Vietnam+Pro:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Bricolage+Grotesque:opsz,wght@12..96,600;12..96,700;12..96,800&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/theme.css">
  <style>
    :root {
      --c-bg: #F4F6F8;
      --c-surface: #FFFFFF;
      --c-text-main: #0B0F19;
      --c-text-dim: #505F79;
      --c-primary: #5A52FF;
      --c-secondary: #FF5E5E;
      --c-accent: #FFB800;
      --c-success: #047857;
      --c-error: #DC2626;
      --c-dark-pod: #0B0F19;
      --c-telemetry: #38BDF8;
    }

    * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    body {
      font-family: 'Be Vietnam Pro', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif;
      background-color: var(--c-bg);
      background-image: radial-gradient(rgba(11, 15, 25, 0.05) 2px, transparent 2px);
      background-size: 32px 32px;
      color: var(--c-text-main);
      min-height: 100vh;
      padding: 32px 24px;
      position: relative;
    }

    .blob {
      position: fixed;
      width: 450px;
      height: 450px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      filter: blur(90px);
      opacity: 0.15;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 0;
    }
    .blob-1 { top: -100px; left: -100px; background: var(--c-primary); }
    .blob-2 { bottom: -100px; right: -100px; background: var(--c-accent); }

    .container {
      max-width: 1360px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
    }

    /* TOP BAR */
    .top-bar {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
      background: var(--c-surface);
      border: 1px solid rgba(11, 15, 25, 0.08);
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 16px 24px;
      box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 #0B0F19;
    }

    .brand-title {
      font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 24px;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .brand-badge {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: 50px;
      background: var(--c-primary);
      color: #FFFFFF;
    }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .nav-btn {
      padding: 8px 16px;
      border-radius: 50px;
      border: 1.5px solid #0B0F19;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #0B0F19;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 13px;
      background: #FFFFFF;
      transition: all 0.15s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 6px;
    }
    .nav-btn:hover {
      background: var(--c-primary);
      color: #FFFFFF;
      box-shadow: 2px 2px 0 #0B0F19;
      transform: translate(-2px, -2px);
    }
    .nav-btn.active {
      background: #0B0F19;
      color: #F4F6F8;
    }

    /* SEARCH HERO SECTION */
    .search-hero {
      background: var(--c-surface);
      border: 1px solid rgba(11, 15, 25, 0.08);
      border-radius: 32px;
      padding: 36px 32px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
      box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 #0B0F19;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .search-hero h2 {
      font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif;
      font-size: 28px;
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
      letter-spacing: -0.5px;
    }
    .search-hero p {
      font-size: 14px;
      color: var(--c-text-dim);
      max-width: 680px;
      margin: 0 auto 24px auto;
    }

    .search-box {
      max-width: 760px;
      margin: 0 auto;
      display: flex;
      gap: 12px;
      background: #FFFFFF;
      padding: 8px;
      border: 2px solid #0B0F19;
      border-radius: 50px;
      box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--c-primary);
    }
    .search-box input {
      flex: 1;
      border: none;
      outline: none;
      padding: 10px 20px;
      font-family: inherit;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 500;
    }
    .search-btn {
      background: #0B0F19;
      color: #FFFFFF;
      border: none;
      padding: 12px 28px;
      border-radius: 50px;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 14px;
      cursor: pointer;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      transition: all 0.15s ease;
    }
    .search-btn:hover {
      background: var(--c-primary);
    }

    .quick-tags {
      margin-top: 14px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .quick-tag {
      font-size: 12px;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 4px 12px;
      background: #F3F4F6;
      border-radius: 50px;
      color: var(--c-text-main);
      text-decoration: none;
      border: 1px solid rgba(11, 15, 25, 0.08);
      transition: all 0.15s ease;
    }
    .quick-tag:hover {
      background: #0B0F19;
      color: #FFFFFF;
    }

    /* MAIN LAYOUT: 2 COLUMNS (TREE & DETAILS) */
    .content-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 420px 1fr;
      gap: 24px;
    }
    @media (max-width: 1024px) {
      .content-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }

    .bento-card {
      background: var(--c-surface);
      border: 1px solid rgba(11, 15, 25, 0.08);
      border-radius: 32px;
      padding: 28px;
      box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 #0B0F19;
    }

    .card-head {
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      padding-bottom: 14px;
      border-bottom: 1.5px dashed rgba(11, 15, 25, 0.12);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
    }
    .card-head h3 {
      font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 20px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    /* TREE CURRICULUM (TCPP.01) */
    .tree-branch {
      margin-bottom: 22px;
    }
    .branch-title {
      font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 700;
      font-size: 15px;
      color: var(--c-text-main);
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }
    .branch-items {
      padding-left: 18px;
      border-left: 2px dashed rgba(11, 15, 25, 0.15);
      margin-left: 10px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .tree-item {
      background: #FFFFFF;
      border: 1.5px solid rgba(11, 15, 25, 0.1);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 10px 14px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--c-text-main);
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 600;
      transition: all 0.15s ease;
    }
    .tree-item:hover {
      box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 var(--c-primary);
      border-color: #0B0F19;
      transform: translate(-2px, -2px);
    }
    .item-type-badge {
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 2px 8px;
      border-radius: 50px;
      background: #F3F4F6;
      color: var(--c-text-dim);
    }

    /* DARK POD / PINOUT / TERMINAL (TCPP.02) */
    .dark-pod {
      background: var(--c-dark-pod);
      color: #F4F6F8;
      border-radius: 24px;
      padding: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      border: 2px solid #0B0F19;
      box-shadow: 4px 4px 0 var(--c-telemetry);
    }
    .dark-pod-head {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      padding-bottom: 10px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    }
    .dark-pod-title {
      font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif;
      font-size: 16px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #FFFFFF;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }
    .terminal-code {
      font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 13px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--c-telemetry);
      white-space: pre-wrap;
      word-break: break-word;
    }

    /* CARD ITEM IN SEARCH RESULTS */
    .result-card {
      background: #FFFFFF;
      border: 1.5px solid rgba(11, 15, 25, 0.12);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
      box-shadow: 3px 3px 0 #0B0F19;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }
    .result-card:hover {
      transform: translate(-2px, -2px);
      box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 var(--c-primary);
    }
    .result-header {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: flex-start;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .result-title {
      font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif;
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: #0B0F19;
    }
    .result-body {
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #374151;
      white-space: pre-line;
    }

    .tip-box {
      background: #FFFBEB;
      border: 1.5px solid #F59E0B;
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 14px 18px;
      margin-top: 12px;
      font-size: 13px;
      color: #92400E;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="blob blob-1"></div>
  <div class="blob blob-2"></div>

  <div class="container">
    <!-- TOP BAR -->
    <header class="top-bar">
      <div class="brand-title">
        <svg width="28" height="28" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0B0F19" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
          <circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3"></circle>
          <path d="M19.4 15a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33 1.82l.06.06a2 2 0 0 1 0 2.83 2 2 0 0 1-2.83 0l-.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82-.33 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1 1.51V21a2 2 0 0 1-2 2 2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 9 19.4a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.82.33l-.06.06a2 2 0 0 1-2.83 0 2 2 0 0 1 0-2.83l.06-.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 .33-1.82 1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51-1H3a2 2 0 0 1-2-2 2 2 0 0 1 2-2h.09A1.65 1.65 0 0 0 4.6 9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33-1.82l-.06-.06a2 2 0 0 1 0-2.83 2 2 0 0 1 2.83 0l.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82.33H9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1-1.51V3a2 2 0 0 1 2-2 2 2 0 0 1 2 2v.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1 1.51 1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.82-.33l.06-.06a2 2 0 0 1 2.83 0 2 2 0 0 1 0 2.83l-.06.06a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-.33 1.82V9a1.65 1.65 0 0 0 1.51 1H21a2 2 0 0 1 2 2 2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-.09a1.65 1.65 0 0 0-1.51 1z"></path>
        </svg>
        <span>STEM Robotic Edu</span>
        <span class="brand-badge">TCPP.01 & TCPP.02</span>
      </div>

      <nav class="nav-links">
        <a href="/materials/tra-cuu" class="nav-btn active">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"/></svg>
          Tra cứu Linh kiện & Pinout
        </a>
        <a href="/materials/quan-ly" class="nav-btn">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M12 20h9"/><path d="M16.5 3.5a2.121 2.121 0 0 1 3 3L7 19l-4 1 1-4L16.5 3.5z"/></svg>
          Quản lý Học liệu (GV)
        </a>
        <a href="/" class="nav-btn">
          <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M3 9l9-7 9 7v11a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z"/></svg>
          Trang chủ
        </a>
      </nav>

      <div class="user-info" style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
        <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#5A52FF" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="7" r="4"/><path d="M6 21v-2a4 4 0 0 1 4-4h4a4 4 0 0 1 4 4v2"/></svg>
        <span>Lớp 10/1 - Học sinh STEM</span>
      </div>
    </header>

    <!-- SEARCH HERO SECTION (TCPP.02) -->
    <section class="search-hero">
      <h2>Tra Cứu Linh Kiện & Gợi Ý Bắt Lỗi Code Tự Động</h2>
      <p>Nhập tên linh kiện (TCRT5000, HC-SR04, Servo SG90, L298N) hoặc thông báo lỗi biên dịch C++/Arduino để nhận ngay sơ đồ Pinout và mẹo khắc phục nhanh.</p>

      <form action="/materials/tra-cuu" method="GET" class="search-box">
        <input type="text" name="q" value="<%= typeof keyword !== 'undefined' ? keyword : '' %>" placeholder="Nhập tên linh kiện, mã lỗi (VD: pulseIn timeout, SG90, ENA, undeclared)..." autofocus>
        <button type="submit" class="search-btn">
          <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"/></svg>
          Tra cứu
        </button>
      </form>

      <div class="quick-tags">
        <span style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--c-text-dim); align-self: center;">Gợi ý tra cứu nhanh:</span>
        <a href="/materials/tra-cuu?q=TCRT5000" class="quick-tag">TCRT5000</a>
        <a href="/materials/tra-cuu?q=HC-SR04" class="quick-tag">HC-SR04</a>
        <a href="/materials/tra-cuu?q=Servo SG90" class="quick-tag">Servo SG90</a>
        <a href="/materials/tra-cuu?q=L298N" class="quick-tag">Mạch cầu H L298N</a>
        <a href="/materials/tra-cuu?q=Arduino Uno R3" class="quick-tag">Arduino Uno R3</a>
        <a href="/materials/tra-cuu?q=pulseIn" class="quick-tag">Lỗi pulseIn</a>
        <a href="/materials/tra-cuu?q=PID" class="quick-tag">PID bám line</a>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CONTENT GRID -->
    <div class="content-grid">
      <!-- CÂY LỘ TRÌNH HỌC (TCPP.01) -->
      <aside class="bento-card">
        <div class="card-head">
          <h3>
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><line x1="6" y1="3" x2="6" y2="15"/><circle cx="18" cy="6" r="3"/><circle cx="6" cy="18" r="3"/><path d="M18 9a9 9 0 0 1-9 9"/></svg>
            Lộ Trình Học Logic
          </h3>
          <span style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; background: #0B0F19; color: #FFF; padding: 3px 8px; border-radius: 50px;">TCPP.01</span>
        </div>

        <% if (typeof treeData !== 'undefined' && treeData) { %>
          <!-- CHỦ ĐỀ CƠ KHÍ -->
          <div class="tree-branch">
            <div class="branch-title">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0B0F19" stroke-width="2"><path d="M14.7 6.3a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.4l1.6 1.6a1 1 0 0 0 1.4 0l3.77-3.77a6 6 0 0 1-7.94 7.94l-6.91 6.91a2.12 2.12 0 0 1-3-3l6.91-6.91a6 6 0 0 1 7.94-7.94l-3.76 3.76z"/></svg>
              1. Khối Cơ Khí & Lắp Ráp
            </div>
            <div class="branch-items">
              <% (treeData['Co khi'] || []).forEach(node => { %>
                <div style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--c-primary); margin-top: 4px;">
                  <%= node.TenLoTrinh %> (<%= node.CapDo %>)
                </div>
                <% node.items.forEach(item => { %>
                  <a href="/materials/tra-cuu?q=<%= encodeURIComponent(item.TenHocLieu) %>" class="tree-item">
                    <span><%= item.TenHocLieu %></span>
                    <span class="item-type-badge"><%= item.LoaiHocLieu %></span>
                  </a>
                <% }) %>
              <% }) %>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- CHỦ ĐỀ MẠCH ĐIỆN -->
          <div class="tree-branch">
            <div class="branch-title">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0B0F19" stroke-width="2"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"/></svg>
              2. Khối Mạch Điện & Linh Kiện
            </div>
            <div class="branch-items">
              <% (treeData['Mach dien'] || []).forEach(node => { %>
                <div style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--c-primary); margin-top: 4px;">
                  <%= node.TenLoTrinh %> (<%= node.CapDo %>)
                </div>
                <% node.items.forEach(item => { %>
                  <a href="/materials/tra-cuu?q=<%= encodeURIComponent(item.TenHocLieu) %>" class="tree-item">
                    <span><%= item.TenHocLieu %></span>
                    <span class="item-type-badge"><%= item.LoaiHocLieu %></span>
                  </a>
                <% }) %>
              <% }) %>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- CHỦ ĐỀ LẬP TRÌNH -->
          <div class="tree-branch">
            <div class="branch-title">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0B0F19" stroke-width="2"><polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"/><polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"/></svg>
              3. Khối Lập Trình Nhúng
            </div>
            <div class="branch-items">
              <% (treeData['Lap trinh'] || []).forEach(node => { %>
                <div style="font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--c-primary); margin-top: 4px;">
                  <%= node.TenLoTrinh %> (<%= node.CapDo %>)
                </div>
                <% node.items.forEach(item => { %>
                  <a href="/materials/tra-cuu?q=<%= encodeURIComponent(item.TenHocLieu) %>" class="tree-item">
                    <span><%= item.TenHocLieu %></span>
                    <span class="item-type-badge"><%= item.LoaiHocLieu %></span>
                  </a>
                <% }) %>
              <% }) %>
            </div>
          </div>
        <% } %>
      </aside>

      <!-- KHOANG HIỂN THỊ KẾT QUẢ / PINOUT & FIX CODE (TCPP.02) -->
      <main class="bento-card">
        <div class="card-head">
          <h3>
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><line x1="12" y1="16" x2="12" y2="12"/><line x1="12" y1="8" x2="12.01" y2="8"/></svg>
            Chi Tiết Linh Kiện & Mẹo Sửa Lỗi TestCase
          </h3>
          <% if (typeof keyword !== 'undefined' && keyword) { %>
            <span style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; color: var(--c-primary);">
              Từ khóa: "<%= keyword %>"
            </span>
          <% } %>
        </div>

        <% if (typeof searchResults !== 'undefined' && searchResults) { %>
          <!-- DANH SÁCH LINH KIỆN & BÀI HỌC TÌM THẤY -->
          <% if (searchResults.componentsAndGuides && searchResults.componentsAndGuides.length > 0) { %>
            <% searchResults.componentsAndGuides.forEach(item => { %>
              <article class="result-card">
                <div class="result-header">
                  <div>
                    <h4 class="result-title"><%= item.TenHocLieu %></h4>
                    <span style="font-size: 12px; color: var(--c-text-dim); font-weight: 600;">
                      Chủ đề: <%= item.ChuDe || 'Kỹ thuật' %> | Phân loại: <%= item.LoaiHocLieu %>
                    </span>
                  </div>
                  <span style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; background: #0B0F19; color: #FFF; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 50px;">
                    #<%= item.MaHocLieu %>
                  </span>
                </div>

                <!-- KHOANG MÔ PHỎNG PINOUT / CODE NỀN TỐI CHUẨN NEO-BRUTALIST -->
                <div class="dark-pod">
                  <div class="dark-pod-head">
                    <span class="dark-pod-title">
                      <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--c-telemetry)" stroke-width="2.5"><polyline points="4 17 10 11 4 5"/><line x1="12" y1="19" x2="20" y2="19"/></svg>
                      Khoang Kỹ Thuật & Sơ Đồ Pinout
                    </span>
                    <span style="font-size: 11px; color: #94A3B8; font-family: monospace;">STEM_TELEMETRY</span>
                  </div>
                  <div class="terminal-code"><%= item.NoiDung %></div>
                </div>

                <% if (item.DuongDanTep) { %>
                  <div style="margin-top: 10px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600;">
                    Tài liệu gốc: <a href="<%= item.DuongDanTep %>" target="_blank" style="color: var(--c-primary);"><%= item.DuongDanTep %></a>
                  </div>
                <% } %>
              </article>
            <% }) %>
          <% } %>

          <!-- DANH SÁCH GỢI Ý SỬA LỖI TỪ TESTCASE -->
          <% if (searchResults.codeFixTips && searchResults.codeFixTips.length > 0) { %>
            <div style="margin-top: 24px; margin-bottom: 14px;">
              <h4 style="font-family: 'Bricolage Grotesque', sans-serif; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700; color: #92400E; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
                <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#D97706" stroke-width="2"><path d="M10.29 3.86L1.82 18a2 2 0 0 0 1.71 3h16.94a2 2 0 0 0 1.71-3L13.71 3.86a2 2 0 0 0-3.42 0z"/><line x1="12" y1="9" x2="12" y2="13"/><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12.01" y2="17"/></svg>
                Gợi Ý Khắc Phục Lỗi TestCase Từ Hệ Thống Chấm
              </h4>
            </div>

            <% searchResults.codeFixTips.forEach(tip => { %>
              <div class="tip-box">
                <div style="font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #B45309;">
                  Dự án: <%= tip.TenDuAn %> (Test Case #<%= tip.MaTestCase %>)
                </div>
                <div style="font-family: monospace; font-size: 12px; margin-bottom: 6px; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.05); padding: 4px 8px; border-radius: 6px;">
                  Đầu vào kiểm thử: <%= tip.DuLieuDauVao %> -> Kết quả mong đợi: <%= tip.KetQuaDauRa %>
                </div>
                <div style="font-weight: 600; line-height: 1.5;">
                  Mẹo sửa lỗi gợi ý: <%= tip.GoiYSuaLoi %>
                </div>
              </div>
            <% }) %>
          <% } %>

          <% if ((!searchResults.componentsAndGuides || searchResults.componentsAndGuides.length === 0) && (!searchResults.codeFixTips || searchResults.codeFixTips.length === 0)) { %>
            <div style="text-align: center; padding: 48px 20px; color: var(--c-text-dim);">
              <svg width="48" height="48" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" style="margin-bottom: 12px; opacity: 0.5;"><circle cx="11" cy="11" r="8"/><line x1="21" y1="21" x2="16.65" y2="16.65"/></svg>
              <h4 style="font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 6px; color: var(--c-text-main);">Không tìm thấy linh kiện hoặc mã lỗi</h4>
              <p style="font-size: 13px;">Hãy thử tìm kiếm với các từ khóa thông dụng như: TCRT5000, SG90, HC-SR04, L298N, pulseIn...</p>
            </div>
          <% } %>
        <% } else { %>
          <!-- MẶC ĐỊNH KHI CHƯA SEARCH: GIỚI THIỆU PINOUT CHUẨN LỚP 10/1 -->
          <div class="dark-pod">
            <div class="dark-pod-head">
              <span class="dark-pod-title">
                <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="var(--c-telemetry)" stroke-width="2.5"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"/></svg>
                Hướng Dẫn Tra Cứu Pinout Kit STEM Robotic Lớp 10/1
              </span>
              <span style="font-size: 11px; color: #94A3B8; font-family: monospace;">SYSTEM_READY</span>
            </div>
            <div class="terminal-code">
========================================================================
           HỆ THỐNG TRA CỨU SƠ ĐỒ CHÂN PINOUT LINH KIỆN CHUẨN
========================================================================
[1] Cảm biến dò line TCRT5000:
    - VCC: 5V (Dùng trở hạn dòng 220 Ohm cho LED IR)
    - GND: Nối mass chung
    - Signal: Nối chân Analog A0, A1 hoặc Digital D2, D3

[2] Động cơ Servo SG90 (0 - 180 độ):
    - Dây Nâu: GND
    - Dây Đỏ: 5V (Khuyến nghị nguồn 5V ngoài nếu kéo tải cơ khí)
    - Dây Vàng/Cam: Xung PWM (~D9, ~D10, ~D11 trên Arduino)

[3] Mạch cầu H L298N (Động cơ DC):
    - ENA / ENB: Cấp xung PWM điều tốc (0 - 255)
    - IN1, IN2 / IN3, IN4: Logic điều hướng chiều quay bánh xe
    - 12V / GND: Nguồn động lực cho motor

Nhập tên linh kiện vào thanh tìm kiếm phía trên để xem chi tiết từng chân nối!
            </div>
          </div>
        <% } %>
      </main>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
